<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA WIN THIRD TEST BY 268 RUNS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA WIN THIRD TEST BY 268 RUNS.</headline>
<dateline>MANCHESTER, England 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia beat England by 268 runs on the fifth and final day of the third test at Old Trafford on Monday to level the six-match series 1-1.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 235 and 395-8 declared, England 162 and 200.</p>
